    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/315939ca1c7b896e35a8f55c3a8d805a.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/315939ca1c7b896e35a8f55c3a8d805a.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/30f22b24ce462ff1689f59bda06ec9c7.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/30f22b24ce462ff1689f59bda06ec9c7.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Katana Punk is a roguelike deck builder set in a neon-lit dystopian Tokyo, about discovering game-breaking synergies.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/cc63f6f3d87b5cb7984e15d7b2bed962.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/cc63f6f3d87b5cb7984e15d7b2bed962.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/03526088da66742eacb8b6907eb223ba.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/03526088da66742eacb8b6907eb223ba.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Take a weak card. Modify it, re-write it's effects,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it hits three times. Now it refunds mana when it crits. Now it hits multiple enemies<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/90179d119ac0b8df4dca1bf60ebbd781.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/90179d119ac0b8df4dca1bf60ebbd781.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This city contains secret alleyways you can't see, break down fake walls and sometimes you'll find some food vendors, and sometimes you'll skips half the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ cards</strong>, every single one can mutate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ card mods</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ passive \u201cTreasures\u201d</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Level\u00a03 tier</strong> once per run, one lucky card gets a chance to be upgraded to Level 3.<br>*\u00a0Example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lv\u00a01</strong> \u00b7 Deal\u00a010 damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lv\u00a02</strong> \u00b7 Deal\u00a020 damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lv\u00a03 (once per run)</strong> \u00b7 Deal\u00a0<strong>100</strong> damage.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/33124341d9237ce2ae6e38569820408a.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/33124341d9237ce2ae6e38569820408a.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/315939ca1c7b896e35a8f55c3a8d805a.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/315939ca1c7b896e35a8f55c3a8d805a.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/30f22b24ce462ff1689f59bda06ec9c7.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/30f22b24ce462ff1689f59bda06ec9c7.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Katana Punk is a roguelike deck builder set in a neon-lit dystopian Tokyo, about discovering game-breaking synergies.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/cc63f6f3d87b5cb7984e15d7b2bed962.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/cc63f6f3d87b5cb7984e15d7b2bed962.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/03526088da66742eacb8b6907eb223ba.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/03526088da66742eacb8b6907eb223ba.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Take a weak card. Modify it, re-write it's effects,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it hits three times. Now it refunds mana when it crits. Now it hits multiple enemies<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/90179d119ac0b8df4dca1bf60ebbd781.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/90179d119ac0b8df4dca1bf60ebbd781.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This city contains secret alleyways you can't see, break down fake walls and sometimes you'll find some food vendors, and sometimes you'll skips half the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ cards</strong>, every single one can mutate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ card mods</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ passive \u201cTreasures\u201d</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Level\u00a03 tier</strong> once per run, one lucky card gets a chance to be upgraded to Level 3.<br>*\u00a0Example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lv\u00a01</strong> \u00b7 Deal\u00a010 damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lv\u00a02</strong> \u00b7 Deal\u00a020 damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lv\u00a03 (once per run)</strong> \u00b7 Deal\u00a0<strong>100</strong> damage.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/33124341d9237ce2ae6e38569820408a.poster.avif?t=1748255627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741870/extras/33124341d9237ce2ae6e38569820408a.webm?t=1748255627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
